                <mxCell id="13" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;Regras para entrar na quarentena:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;* Se os dados apresentarem valores biologicamente impossíveis&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0,0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;* Taxas de Nulos Graves:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Registos (linhas baseadas num&amp;nbsp;&lt;i data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;53&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;timestamp&lt;/i&gt;) onde a esmagadora maioria dos&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0,0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;sensores não emitiu qualquer valor.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0,1&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-40&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0,2&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;O sistema deve avaliar a fiabilidade do equipamento e isolar taxas de nulos graves&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0,3&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;4&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0,4&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0,4&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;*&amp;nbsp;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Erros de Formato/Schema:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;25&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Timestamps&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;corrompido